  "releaseNotes": "### 🐛 Fixes\n\n- **A pause while the download is starting is kept again.** 6.0.0 made `Pause()` and `Resume()` do nothing unless the download was Running or Paused, so a `Pause()` while the server was still asked for the size (status None or Created) was lost and the download ran on. Now only a finished download (Completed, Failed or Stopped) ignores them.",
